# with-context: shared binding regression test
# Verifies that with-context does not destroy the source thunk's unevaluated
# state. Previously, with_replaced_ctx took (stole) the unevaluated state from
# the source thunk, leaving it permanently InProgress. Subsequent access to the
# same binding would report a CircularDependency error.
# Fix: with_replaced_ctx now clones the unevaluated state, leaving the original
# thunk intact.
